          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.12.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 12:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibgiye mu mutima wanje, nt’ Enda nkugeragereshe ibinezereza; nuko rer’ uhimbarwe n’ivyiza: kandi rāba n’ivyo na vyo vyabaye ivy’ ubusa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PRO.14.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Imig 14:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Navuze ku bitwengo, nti Birasaze, no ku binezereza, nti Bimaze iki? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niziganguye mu mutima wanje uko nonezeresha umubiri wanje vino, umutima wanje ukindōngōresha ubgenge, n’ingene nokurikira ubupfu, kugira ngo mbone ivyo abana b’abantu bakwiye gukorera musi y’ijuru imisi yose y’ukubaho kwabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.7.1+1KI.7.2+1KI.7.3+1KI.7.4+1KI.7.5+1KI.7.6+1KI.7.7+1KI.7.8+1KI.7.9+1KI.7.10+1KI.7.11+1KI.7.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Abam 7:1-12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "SNG.8.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ind 8:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikoreye ibikorwa bikomeye; niyubakiye amazu; nitereye uruzabibu henshi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "SNG.4.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ind 4:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "SNG.5.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "5:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nironkeye indimiro n’amatongo, nteramw’ ibiti vyama vy’imyuga myinshi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nigomereye amazi ngw avomerwe ingemwe z’ibiti vyatewe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.14.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ita 14:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "niguriye abagurano b’ abagabo n’abakobga, bavyarira abandi mu rugo rwanje; kandi nagize itunga ryinshi ry’amasho n’ imikuku kurusha abāntanguriye bose i Yerusalemu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.4.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Abam 4:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.9.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "9:28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.10.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "10:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.11.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "11:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.35.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ngo 35:25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi nirundiye ifeza n’izahabu, bo n’itunga riherereye ku bami rivuye mu ntāra zose; nirondereye abaririmvyi b’abagabo n’abakobga, bo n’ibinezereza abana b’abantu, ni vyo ncoreke nyinshi cane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.29.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Ngo 29:25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ECC.1.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Umus 1:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko nabaye agahambaye, nunguka kurusha abāntanguriye bose i Yerusalemu: kand’ ubgenge bganje bgāgumanye nanje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ECC.3.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Umus 3:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikintu cose amaso yanje yifuza sinakiyima, kandi sinabujije umutima wanje ikinezereza na kimwe, kand’ umutima wanje wanezerezwa n’ubutame bganje bgose; kand’ ivyo bimbera umugabane uvuye mu butame bganje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ECC.1.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Umus 1:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ECC.1.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze nditegereza ibikorwa vyose amaboko yanje yakoze, bo n’ubutame natamye: kandi rāba, vyose vyabaye ubusa no guhahamira umuyaga, kandi nta nyungu iriho musi y’izuba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ECC.1.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Umus 1:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ECC.1.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze ndahindukira ngo nitegereze ubgenge n’ubujuju n’ubupfu: non’ umuntu azosubira ku ngoma akurikiye umwami azogenza ate? Azokora icari carakozwe nyene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi mbona yuko mu bgenge har’ inyungu kuruta mu bupfu, nk’uko mu muco har’ inyungu kuruta mu mwiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PRO.17.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Imig 17:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ECC.9.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Umus 9:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umunyabgenge amaso yiwe aba mu mutwe, arikw igipfu co kigendera mu mwiza: yamara nabonye yukw iherezo rya bompi ari rimwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze ndibaza mu mutima wanje, nt’ Iherezo ry’igipfu ni ryo rizoba iherezo ryanje; none se, kumurusha ubgenge vyammariye iki? Maze ndavuga mu mutima wanje, yuko na vyo ar’ ubusa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ECC.1.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Umus 1:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ar’ umunyabgenge, ar’ igipfu, nta wuzohora yibukwa ibihe vyose; kuko mu misi izoza bose bazoba bamaze kwibagirana. Ereg’ umunyabgenge apfa nk’ukw igipfu gipfa na co! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko nca nanka ubugingo, kukw ibikorwa bikorerwa musi y’izuba vyammereye nabi: kuko vyose ar’ ubusa no guhahamira umuyaga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
